OL,3,GNEWSAFinding confidence and friendship
OL,4,Athrough art
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdults with Down's syndrome and their
OL,7,Ffamilies say art classes have helped
OL,8,Fthem develop their confidence and learn
OL,9,Fnew skills - with their work featuring
OL,10,Fin a new exhibition.
OL,12,FThe work was created by those who
OL,13,Fattend sessions held by charity Down's
OL,14,FSyndrome North East, which welcomes
OL,15,Fadults of all ages with the condition
OL,16,Fstretching from Teesside to
OL,17,FNorthumberland.
OL,19,FThe exhibition was first held at The
OL,20,FAlnwick Garden and has now moved to
OL,21,FCounty Hall in Morpeth, where it is on
OL,22,Fshow until 3 December.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
