OL,3,GNEWSAFinding confidence and friendship
OL,4,Athrough art
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteer Ros Collinson said: "We tell
OL,7,Fthem they can't get it wrong,
OL,8,Feverybody's an artist and we value
OL,9,Feverybody, no matter how complex their
OL,10,Fneeds are."
